     "titulo": "Following a written talk",
     "texto": [
      "Look for structural signals: **først**, **et eksempel**, **med andre ord** and **til slutt**. Group notes under the central idea, example and limit. This unit shows a written transcript, not a recorded talk or authentic audio."
